sequenceDiagram
    participant M as AIManager
    participant P as ParallelAIProvider
    participant E as ThreadPoolExecutor
    participant G1 as GeminiProvider (primary)
    participant G2 as GeminiProvider (fallback)
    participant H as AIHandlerManager

    M->>P: generate(prompt)
    activate P
    P->>E: submit(_ask, primary, prompt)
    P->>E: submit(_ask, fallback, prompt)

    par worker thread ai-provider_0
        E->>G1: generate(prompt)
        G1-->>E: text or AIConnectionError
        E->>H: is_valid(text)
        H-->>E: True or False
    and worker thread ai-provider_1
        E->>G2: generate(prompt)
        G2-->>E: text or AIConnectionError
        E->>H: is_valid(text)
        H-->>E: True or False
    end

    loop until a valid answer or the timeout
        P->>E: wait(pending, FIRST_COMPLETED)
        E-->>P: finished futures
        alt a finished future holds a valid answer
            P->>P: last_winner = provider.name
            P-->>M: text (the slower thread is ignored)
        else it failed or was invalid
            P->>P: failures[provider.name] = error
        end
    end

    alt at least one connection error or timeout
        P-->>M: raise AllProvidersFailedError(failures)
    else every model answered, none validly
        P-->>M: raise AIResponseError
    end
    deactivate P

    Note over M: AIManager retries up to MAX_RETRIES times,<br/>unless the error is not retryable (e.g. no API key)
